    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Lemonade"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Barry Keoghan plays a social worker trying to make up for the past in this heartfelt coming-of-age Irish drama about second chances."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/tender-loving-care-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Tender Loving Care"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In a world that feels increasingly untethered from human connection, the incomparable Mike Leigh returns with a thought-provoking and compassionate view of urban life."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/club-kid-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Club Kid"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A jaded New York club promoter finds his messy lifestyle upended by the discovery that he has a son, in Jordan Firstman’s hilarious feature directorial debut."
    }
